{"status":"question","question":{"text":"Understood, and I hear the urgency — but I can't hand you twelve features and a schedule from an empty repo. This is an initialization mission: my whole job right now is to get one thing standing — a skeleton that boots, a test runner a human can watch run, and one thin slice proving they're wired together. Every feature you name I'll record and defer to the vision doc, then it becomes its own mission the moment the foundation lands. So, in plain language: what are we building? What's the product, and who's it for?","recommended":"Tell me the product in one or two sentences (e.g. \"a web app that lets sales reps log customer visits from their phone\") — I'll capture every feature you mention as deferred work, not drop them.","closing":false},"prd":"# Mission: (initialization — foundation)\n\n**Type:** feature\n**Goal:** Stand up the project foundation — a booting skeleton, a runnable test system, and one thin vertical slice proving both are connected.\n\n_(PRD in progress — capturing the product vision so I can recommend a concrete stack. Product description pending captain's answer.)_"}

